docs {
  # B2B Callback
  
  Receives Business to Business payment result callbacks.
  
  ## When Called
  After B2B payment is processed (PayBill or Buy Goods).
  
  ## ResultCodes
  - 0: Success
  - Other codes indicate failure reasons
  
  **Note**: Called by Safaricom servers after B2B payment processing.
}
